earth: new hours, a new way of doing the job and a target by every name, and {Ns} way of working fits none of it
tribal: the hunt leader has changed how the hunts are run, and {Ns} way of tracking has no place in it
magic: the guild master has decreed a new method for every journeyman, and {Ns} own craft does not fit it
scene: From Monday, says {clash.holder}, things at {clash.setting} are done differently: new hours, a new way of doing the job, and a target on the board by every name. {Ns} way of doing the work, the one {N} is good at, fits none of it. There is rent to pay, and people counting on the wage.
scene tribal: The hunt leader has changed how the hunts are run: everyone in one line, at one pace, by one plan. {Ns} way of tracking, the one that has fed families for years, has no place in it, and the winter is coming.
scene magic: The guild master of {clash.setting} has decreed a new method for every journeyman, from the first cut to the last polish. {Ns} own craft does not fit it, and the guild's seal is what brings the work in.
- W | point out in the staff meeting that the change breaks the agreed terms | v: conformity, universalism | clash: confront | foot: person rival | chance: 50
- U | learn the new system inside out, and wait for its flaws to show | v: self-direction, achievement | clash: give_in | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 85
- B | take the better offer from across town, and say why on the way out | v: power, achievement | clash: leave | foot: means money+.06 | chance: 60
- R | go out after work with the people who do the job the way you do | v: hedonism, stimulation | clash: own_scene | foot: place gather.night | chance: 80
- G | ask {clash.ally}, who has been here longest, to help find a middle way | v: benevolence, tradition | clash: bridge | foot: person go-between | chance: 55
