scene: A plan for {clash.setting} has been passed by {clash.holder}: the common by {Ns} street will be built over, the street market moved, and new rules set on what may be done in one's own front yard. {N} has lived here for years, and the plan runs straight through the part of town {N} cares about.
scene tribal: The clan's council has chosen to move camp across the river when the snows end. The new ground is better for the herds and worse for everything {N} has built here, and the choice has been made.
scene magic: The council of {clash.setting} has granted the old common to a builder-mage. Towers will rise where the market stood, and new rules come with them on what may be done on one's own doorstep.
